    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/cdf4c90bf9e6a10d3cff76001316630b.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/cdf4c90bf9e6a10d3cff76001316630b.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/cdf4c90bf9e6a10d3cff76001316630b.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As someone who has inherited the power of a mighty necromancer, you must confront the 'Lord of Death' to rescue your trapped companion, venturing through the Tartarus, where the most dangerous monsters and demons are imprisoned. Test your abilities to see if you can survive and reach your destination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resurrect Monsters as Champions</h2>You can resurrect monsters with various abilities as Champions, able to summon them at any time. However, each Champion has their own story related to death. Understanding and empathizing with their pain is crucial to becoming a true master.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/582c466e2ca0178cf86254070d2c3fb0.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/582c466e2ca0178cf86254070d2c3fb0.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/582c466e2ca0178cf86254070d2c3fb0.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summoning and Possession</h2>You can summon Champions to fight alongside you or possess them directly to exploit enemy weaknesses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/78438afe63ecffccd6f7db80b1633dba.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/78438afe63ecffccd6f7db80b1633dba.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/78438afe63ecffccd6f7db80b1633dba.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Champion</h2>You can customize your own powerful Champions by assembling parts such as heads, bodies, arms, legs, wings, tail and so on, which can be attached to any part of the body or other parts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/1912f47b6d0b0650a18699cd781c8fac.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/1912f47b6d0b0650a18699cd781c8fac.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/1912f47b6d0b0650a18699cd781c8fac.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Weapons and Powerful Necromancy</h2>Necromancers can absorb the life and soul of enemies, and powerful necromancy instills fear in their foes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/56402106081adcaeb6ea8a764d7693ca.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/56402106081adcaeb6ea8a764d7693ca.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/56402106081adcaeb6ea8a764d7693ca.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gate to the Abyss</h2>The Necrostone is a gate that seals the rift leading to the realm of spirits, the Abyss, and has long been strictly controlled by necromancers. However, When the legendary necromancer, 'Gula,' falls into an enemy trap and disappears without a trace, the world plunges into darkness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/4f09a194ba9b37aacdd208e5d47d739d.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/4f09a194ba9b37aacdd208e5d47d739d.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/4f09a194ba9b37aacdd208e5d47d739d.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/cdf4c90bf9e6a10d3cff76001316630b.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/cdf4c90bf9e6a10d3cff76001316630b.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/cdf4c90bf9e6a10d3cff76001316630b.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>As someone who has inherited the power of a mighty necromancer, you must confront the 'Lord of Death' to rescue your trapped companion, venturing through the Tartarus, where the most dangerous monsters and demons are imprisoned. Test your abilities to see if you can survive and reach your destination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resurrect Monsters as Champions</h2>You can resurrect monsters with various abilities as Champions, able to summon them at any time. However, each Champion has their own story related to death. Understanding and empathizing with their pain is crucial to becoming a true master.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/582c466e2ca0178cf86254070d2c3fb0.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/582c466e2ca0178cf86254070d2c3fb0.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/582c466e2ca0178cf86254070d2c3fb0.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Summoning and Possession</h2>You can summon Champions to fight alongside you or possess them directly to exploit enemy weaknesses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/78438afe63ecffccd6f7db80b1633dba.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/78438afe63ecffccd6f7db80b1633dba.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/78438afe63ecffccd6f7db80b1633dba.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create Your Own Champion</h2>You can customize your own powerful Champions by assembling parts such as heads, bodies, arms, legs, wings, tail and so on, which can be attached to any part of the body or other parts.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/1912f47b6d0b0650a18699cd781c8fac.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/1912f47b6d0b0650a18699cd781c8fac.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/1912f47b6d0b0650a18699cd781c8fac.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Various Weapons and Powerful Necromancy</h2>Necromancers can absorb the life and soul of enemies, and powerful necromancy instills fear in their foes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/56402106081adcaeb6ea8a764d7693ca.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/56402106081adcaeb6ea8a764d7693ca.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/56402106081adcaeb6ea8a764d7693ca.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Gate to the Abyss</h2>The Necrostone is a gate that seals the rift leading to the realm of spirits, the Abyss, and has long been strictly controlled by necromancers. However, When the legendary necromancer, 'Gula,' falls into an enemy trap and disappears without a trace, the world plunges into darkness.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/4f09a194ba9b37aacdd208e5d47d739d.poster.avif?t=1744183950\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/4f09a194ba9b37aacdd208e5d47d739d.webm?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2867420/extras/4f09a194ba9b37aacdd208e5d47d739d.mp4?t=1744183950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
